# every text the panel builds stays inside what it is built in: every combination of each layer's sound, the melody's mode, pattern, Skip and Latch, the editor's headers, the effects', Setup's reading at its largest, the card, the break, every knob's every value, what the reader says. "textroom" counts what would not fit its buffer, and proves a buffer too small is never written past
# (under tests/host/san-run.sh, AddressSanitizer watches all of it, and the two ways in below)
wait 300
expect textroom 0
expect unfit 0
# by hand, as the owner would: the Melody page, Music box, Keys Arp, Up-Down: the header is drawn
tap ARP
wait 1600
press SEL
turn K1 5
turn K2 1
turn K3 2
release SEL
wait 1600
expect par31 5
expect par32 3
expect par33 2
expect view 2
# the longest there is: Skip 100 and Latch, and it comes back from the flash
setpar 34 100
setpar 35 1
wait 300
expect view 2
expect stale 0
shot melody_longest.png
tap SAVE
wait 1500
reboot
wait 3000
expect par31 5
expect par34 100
expect par35 1
tap ARP
wait 1600
expect view 2
expect stale 0
# every sound in turn with it, and back
press SEL
turn K1 3
wait 200
turn K1 5
wait 200
release SEL
wait 300
expect textroom 0
